#: ../../content/applications/productivity/dashboards/build_and_customize_dashboards.rst:187
msgid ""
":doc:`adding new global filters "
"<../spreadsheet/work_with_data/global_filters>` or editing or deleting "
"existing ones;"
msgstr ""
":doc:`добавяне на нови глобални филтри <../spreadsheet/work_with_data/"
